# Memory dream

This project's dreaming pass. The method lives in the global `enable-memory-management` skill, so
fixes to it reach every project; this file holds what is particular to this one.

| | |
|---|---|
| Memory | `{{MEMORY_DIR}}` |
| Steering | `{{MEMORY_DIR}}/STEERING.md` |
| Sessions | {{TRANSCRIPTS}} |
| Leave out of the audit | {{EXCLUDE}} |
| Reports | `{{REPORTS}}` |

Run `/memory:enable-memory-management --dream --memory {{MEMORY_DIR}}{{EXCLUDE_FLAG}}` and follow
its section 5. When that skill is not installed, say so and point to
https://github.com/madsstoumann/agent-17 (install: `/plugin marketplace add madsstoumann/agent-17`,
then `/plugin install memory@agent-17`); do not improvise a dream run without it.

A scheduled run writes the proposal report and stops. Nothing is applied until a person accepts
proposals by number.
